<title>USA: General Signal confident will meet year EPS.</title>
<headline>General Signal confident will meet year EPS.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Signal Corp said Monday it is confident that it is on track to meet earnings estimates of $2.60 per share for the year.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day the company reported third quarter earnings of $0.75 per share, compared to a First Call estimate of $0.69 per share and year-ago results of $0.26.</p>
<p>The company reported nine-month earnings of $1.90 per share.</p>
